{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>You shall not make yourselves detestable.</b> By eating them — for it is written ״נַפְשֹׁתֵיכֶם״ and ״שִׁקּוּץ״ of a soul is not by touching; and likewise ״וְלֹא תְטַמְּאוּ״ — by eating them." "<b>And you shall become defiled through them.</b> If you become defiled through them on earth — I too will defile you in the World to Come and in the session on high (Yoma 39)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:59.500205969Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}